                dd_[18] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+0)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+0)]);
                dd_[19] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+1)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+1)]);
                dd_[20] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+2)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+2)]);
                dd_[21] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+3)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+3)]);
                dd_[22] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+4)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+4)]);
                dd_[23] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+3)*nao+(i0+5)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+3)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+5)]);
                dd_[24] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+0)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+0)]);
                dd_[25] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+1)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+1)]);
                dd_[26] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+2)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+2)]);
                dd_[27] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+3)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+3)]);
                dd_[28] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+4)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+4)]);
                dd_[29] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+4)*nao+(i0+5)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+4)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+5)]);
                dd_[30] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+0)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+0)]);
                dd_[31] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+1)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+1)]);
                dd_[32] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+2)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+2)]);
                dd_[33] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+3)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+3)]);
                dd_[34] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+4)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+4)]);
                dd_[35] += dfac * (dm[(jj+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(ll_+5)*nao+(i0+5)] + dm[(jj+0)*nao+(ll_+5)] * dm[(kk+0)*nao+(i0+5)]);
            }
            if (do_j) {
                dfac = fac_sym * j_factor;
                dd_[0] += dfac * (dm[(ll_+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(jj+0)*nao+(i0+0)]);
                dd_[1] += dfac * (dm[(ll_+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(jj+0)*nao+(i0+1)]);
                dd_[2] += dfac * (dm[(ll_+0)*nao+(kk+0)] * dm[(jj+0)*nao+(i0+2)]);
